000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RATMAR01.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE UNDERWRITING SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* RATMAR01  MARINE CARGO RATING
000600* CALLED BY PRMCALC (BATCH) AND PRMCALC0 (CICS) AS 'RATMAR01'.
000700* SETS RATE-BASE-PREMIUM FROM THE SUM-INSURED BAND, THEN ADDS
000800* LINE LOADINGS AND DISCOUNTS FROM THE 60-BYTE RISK DETAIL.
000900* BANDS AND RATES ARE THE SAME AS dw.ref_rate_band IN claimsdb.
001000*================================================================
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001300     COPY RDMAR.
001400 01  WS-BAND                     PIC X(02).
001500 01  WS-PCT                      PIC 9V9999.
001600 LINKAGE SECTION.
001700     COPY POLREC.
001800     COPY RATEREC.
001900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD.
002000 0000-MAIN.
002100     MOVE POL-RISK-DETAIL TO WS-MAR-DETAIL
002200     PERFORM 1000-BASE-RATE
002300     PERFORM 2000-LOADINGS
002400     MOVE ZERO TO RATE-RETURN-CODE
002500     GOBACK.
002600 1000-BASE-RATE.
002700     EVALUATE TRUE
002800         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 250000
002900             MOVE 'B1' TO WS-BAND
003000             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003100                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00359
003200         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 1000000
003300             MOVE 'B2' TO WS-BAND
003400             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003500                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00313
003600         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 5000000
003700             MOVE 'B3' TO WS-BAND
003800             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003900                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00244
004000         WHEN OTHER
004100*            ABOVE THE TOP BAND: RATE AT THE TOP BAND, REFER
004200             MOVE 'XX' TO WS-BAND
004300             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004400                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00244
004500             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
004600     END-EVALUATE
004700     IF RATE-BASE-PREMIUM < 450.00
004800         MOVE 450.00 TO RATE-BASE-PREMIUM
004900     END-IF.
005000 2000-LOADINGS.
005100     IF WS-CARGO-CLASS > 12
005200         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
005300             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.040
005400     END-IF
005500     IF WS-CARGO-CLASS > 36
005600         SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
005700     END-IF
005800     IF WS-VOYAGE-ZONE > 3
005900         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
006000             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.100
006100     END-IF
006200     IF WS-VOYAGE-ZONE > 9
006300         SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
006400     END-IF
006500     IF WS-REFRIGERATED = 'Y'
006600         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
006700             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
006800     END-IF
006900     IF WS-WAR-RISK = 'Y'
007000         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007100             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.040
007200     END-IF
007300     IF WS-CONTAINERISED = 'Y'
007400         COMPUTE RATE-DISCOUNTS ROUNDED = RATE-DISCOUNTS
007500             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.250
007600     END-IF.
